# Internal working set — planning docs, personal notes, raw research. Never committed.
# This repo is public at submission, so the boundary is: docs/ is written for readers,
# docs/internal/ is written for us. See docs/DISCLOSURE.md.
# Promoting anything out of here is a deliberate per-document decision, not a default.
docs/internal/

